==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Tentacruel|72}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*'''Wave Splash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Golduck|S3}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 3}}.
